"/docs.kde.org</ulink> इति पश्यन्तु ।"

#: index.docbook:92
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&sheets; is a full featured spreadsheet program. It is part of the "
"&calligra; productivity suite for &kde;."
msgstr ""
"&sheets; पूर्णविशेषतायुक्तः स्प्रेड्शीट् कार्यक्रमः अस्ति । अयं &calligra; "
"&kde; कृते उत्पादकतासूट्।"

#: index.docbook:95
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Other &calligra; applications include &words;, (word processing), &stage; "
"(slide presentation creator) among others."
msgstr ""
"अन्ये &calligra; अनुप्रयोगेषु &words;, (शब्दसंसाधनम्), &stage; (slide "
"presentation creator) इत्यादिषु ।"

#: index.docbook:98
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might care to visit <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org\"> "
"http://www.kde.org</ulink> for more information about &kde; in general, or "
"the &calligra; web site at <ulink url=\"http://www.calligra.org\"> "
"http://www.calligra.org</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"&kde; सामान्यतः, अथवा &calligra; जालस्थलं <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.calligra.org\"> http://www.calligra.org</ulink> इत्यत्र"

